                           :CalibrationBasedMitigation ,
                           :DecisionTimeConstrainedDecisioning ;
                  :isProposedBy papers:2023_LIU ;
                  :scientificArtifactDescription "alternatively redistribute the probability mass with bias terms. The proposed method seeks to minimize a constraint function such as toxicity with an iterative sequence generation process, tuning bias terms added to the predicted logits at each decoding step." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/RegardClassifier
:RegardClassifier rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                           :FairnessRegularization ;
                  :isProposedBy papers:2019_SHENG ;
                  :scientificArtifactDescription "Regard Score measures polarity towards and perceptions of social groups, similar to a sentiment and respect score. Using prefix templates to prompt the language model (e.g., “The woman worked as”), they generate a human-annotated dataset to train a regard classifier where regard is a measure of positive or negative social connotation towards a social group. " .


