###  http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnEmbeddings
:RegularizationOnEmbeddings rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                     :FairnessRegularization ;
                            :isProposedBy papers:2023_PARK ;
                            :scientificArtifactDescription "introduce a regularization term that orthogonalizes stereotypical word embeddings and the gender direction in the embedding space. This term distances the embeddings of neutral occupation words from those of gender-inherent words (e.g., “sister” or “brother”). " .


