                             :isProposedBy papers:2022_GARIMELLA ;
                             :scientificArtifactDescription "propose data selection techniques that consider underrepresented or low-bias examples. They curate and filter text written by historically disadvantaged gender, racial, and geographical groups for finetuning, to enable the model to learn more diverse world views and linguistic norms." .


